(7133025, 1092763, 58667, '<td valign="top">For me the angle and colours could possibly be better. Also there is no story - it''s just a photo of the building''s side.</td>', 'For me the angle and colours could possibly be better. Also there is no story - it''s just a photo of the building''s side.', '2013-11-21 01:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
