(7133048, 1092685, 58667, '<td valign="top">One of the not unique photos, but well executed. I have one critique and that is the <strike>right</strike> left most glass reflects the one behind it awkwardly.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-11-27 02:36:53.</i></td>', 'One of the not unique photos, but well executed. I have one critique and that is the right left most glass reflects the one behind it awkwardly.', '2013-11-21 01:57:51.000000', '2013-11-27 02:36:53.000000', 1),
(7133049, 1092614, 58667, '<td valign="top">This is great! The focus and composition enhance what''s going on so well! Excellent shot.</td>', 'This is great! The focus and composition enhance what''s going on so well! Excellent shot.', '2013-11-21 01:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133050, 1092483, 58667, '<td valign="top">This is a more interesting one! The colours are fantastic! This is the colour of glass. I also love how the king is standing up. Great idea and excellent composition.</td>', 'This is a more interesting one! The colours are fantastic! This is the colour of glass. I also love how the king is standing up. Great idea and excellent composition.', '2013-11-21 02:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133052, 1092664, 58667, '<td valign="top">Is this really glass? For me, the angle is awkward. It''s also difficult to see what''s in focus.</td>', 'Is this really glass? For me, the angle is awkward. It''s also difficult to see what''s in focus.', '2013-11-21 02:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133053, 1092306, 58667, '<td valign="top">Wow! Symmetry like I''ve never seen in a photo. I love how the water (?) is like glass too. Awesome stuff!</td>', 'Wow! Symmetry like I''ve never seen in a photo. I love how the water (?) is like glass too. Awesome stuff!', '2013-11-21 02:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133055, 1091916, 58667, '<td valign="top">This is really a great shot, but the glass is an abstract concept in it. I would never think "glass" if I saw this outside of the challenge (or at least would never have realised glass was involved). To me, honestly, any photo of anything would fit into this challenge if this one did because every photo is taken through a lens. Anyway, I don''t vote down much on DNMC, but I''m sure you might get hammered for it.</td>', 'This is really a great shot, but the glass is an abstract concept in it. I would never think "glass" if I saw this outside of the challenge (or at least would never have realised glass was involved). To me, honestly, any photo of anything would fit into this challenge if this one did because every photo is taken through a lens. Anyway, I don''t vote down much on DNMC, but I''m sure you might get hammered for it.', '2013-11-21 02:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133056, 1092537, 58667, '<td valign="top">Not busy for a glass building shot, so well done. The colours are also spot on for me.</td>', 'Not busy for a glass building shot, so well done. The colours are also spot on for me.', '2013-11-21 02:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
