(7135595, 1092685, 67688, '<td valign="top">I am intrigued and hope the membership wont shoot me down.<br/>Here is a shot that surely has captured all that the challenge was about and scored a lovely 6.6465 from all the voters.<br/>Like any work of art there are of course different folk having different feelings about the way it was shot and the overall technical quality etcetcc.<br/>My question is this.. how can something that nearly 100 people vote on with an average score of 7 still have 2 people only give it a 1??? Is this voting really honest? Just my opinion.. sure it may well have some technical faults but a 1??.. would love the folk who voted this a one to please give us their reasons .. it would help me as a regular follower of this great site to understand their thinking more.<br/>Thanks<br/></td>', 'I am intrigued and hope the membership wont shoot me down.Here is a shot that surely has captured all that the challenge was about and scored a lovely 6.6465 from all the voters.Like any work of art there are of course different folk having different feelings about the way it was shot and the overall technical quality etcetcc.My question is this.. how can something that nearly 100 people vote on with an average score of 7 still have 2 people only give it a 1??? Is this voting really honest? Just my opinion.. sure it may well have some technical faults but a 1??.. would love the folk who voted this a one to please give us their reasons .. it would help me as a regular follower of this great site to understand their thinking more.Thanks', '2013-11-27 05:12:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7135601, 1092614, 20799, '<td valign="top">Beautiful concept, Anita.</td>', 'Beautiful concept, Anita.', '2013-11-27 05:23:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7135603, 1092783, 20799, '<td valign="top">Great image and title.</td>', 'Great image and title.', '2013-11-27 05:26:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7135605, 1092307, 81362, '<td valign="top">Original, lovely, gallery-worthy. Oriental feeling even before seeing title.  Branching cracks in glass perfect complement to twig branches. Got vote of 10 from me without hesitation.</td>', 'Original, lovely, gallery-worthy. Oriental feeling even before seeing title.  Branching cracks in glass perfect complement to twig branches. Got vote of 10 from me without hesitation.', '2013-11-27 05:40:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7135607, 1092311, 109227, '<td valign="top">Great job Margaret.</td>', 'Great job Margaret.', '2013-11-27 05:53:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7135621, 1092612, 28427, '<td valign="top">I thought this would have scored much higher.<br/>Great how the paint keeps the form of the vase in its continuation.<br/>What causes the blue in the pink?</td>', 'I thought this would have scored much higher.Great how the paint keeps the form of the vase in its continuation.What causes the blue in the pink?', '2013-11-27 07:20:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7135624, 1092810, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is extremely well-crafted and the palette is gorgeous. I keep finding myself wishing the base of the foreground glass was slightly ABOVE the rims of the BG glasses: something about the perfect tangency bugs me. It''s a niggle. Beautiful lighting. Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'This is extremely well-crafted and the palette is gorgeous. I keep finding myself wishing the base of the foreground glass was slightly ABOVE the rims of the BG glasses: something about the perfect tangency bugs me. It''s a niggle. Beautiful lighting. Congrats on the ribbon.', '2013-11-27 07:38:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7135625, 1092608, 30861, '<td valign="top">Love the soft/sharp duality here. The gem-like colors and the waft of fog elevate the image above the sterile. Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Love the soft/sharp duality here. The gem-like colors and the waft of fog elevate the image above the sterile. Congrats on the ribbon!', '2013-11-27 07:40:01.000000', NULL, 0),
